#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:5
#: 2e353e771f634d138b62e08b55e8caf8
msgid "Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux"
msgstr "Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:10
#: 6b2720c0b7c94e05b4b1bf30440528fd
msgid ""
"The Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux is a relatively inexpensive four wheel drive "
"RC car with a top speed of about 1m/s."
msgstr "Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux 是一款价格相对低廉的四驱遥控车，最高速度约为 1m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:12
#: dea709a4289b4f0dae4a29aff047a34a
msgid ""
"One weakness of this frame is the suspension is a bit soft once the frame is"
" loaded up with the required electronics (autopilot, GPS, receiver) which "
"leads to some body role during stops."
msgstr "该车架的一个缺点是，加装所需电子设备（自动驾驶仪、GPS、接收机）后悬架略显偏软，导致停车时有些车身侧倾。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:15
#: b6c6b0e76af64816b1d15cb9278ecfbb
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:17
#: 153557ef5e6547379ff6580bda740739
msgid ""
"`Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux frame <https://www.thundertiger.com/products-"
"detail.php?id=74>`__ available from many retailers including `Amazon "
"<https://www.amazon.com/Thunder-Tiger-TOYOTA-HILUX-PICK-UP/dp/B071WJCMKN>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux 车架 <https://www.thundertiger.com/products-"
"detail.php?id=74>`__，可从多家零售商购买，包括 `Amazon <https://www.amazon.com/Thunder-"
"Tiger-TOYOTA-HILUX-PICK-UP/dp/B071WJCMKN>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:18
#: 6eb5da79ff7c41699249affabfe3bbf0
msgid ":ref:`Hex Cube autopilot <common-thecube-overview>` or similar"
msgstr ":ref:`Hex Cube 自动驾驶仪 <common-thecube-overview>` 或类似产品"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:19
#: d182c30692314913a461e49a3a1a78c5
msgid ""
":ref:`Adafruit ESP8266 <common-esp8266-telemetry>` wifi telemetry board"
msgstr ":ref:`Adafruit ESP8266 <common-esp8266-telemetry>` WiFi 数传板"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:20
#: 118063c22a0a41eab517485c8dce629f
msgid ""
"any 8 channel (or more) transmitter like the `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__ (the 2 channel"
" transmitter/receiver provided with the frame is not currently supported by "
"ArduPilot)"
msgstr ""
"任意 8 通道（或更多）发射机，如 `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__（车架附带的 2 "
"通道发射机/接收机目前不受 ArduPilot 支持）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:23
#: 7adb3dd3d2694ab5970e33b2e29f779a
msgid "Mounting the electronics"
msgstr "安装电子设备"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:31
#: 89b4cd9193694f3ba48f7216257ce632
msgid ""
"the Cube autopilot fits easily into front portion of the frame of the "
"vehicle"
msgstr "Cube 自动驾驶仪可轻松放入车架前部空间"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:32
#: 3f455cf9b36d42faae25785943a9e7b8
msgid ""
"the GPS should be placed away from the motor and battery.  In this example "
"it was placed in the rear cargo bed"
msgstr "GPS 应远离电机和电池放置。本示例将其安装在后货床"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:33
#: 2faff699e2a84da8b70ad5f149c46e66
msgid ""
"some soldering is required to allow the 2S battery to plug into the power "
"module"
msgstr "需要少量焊接以便将 2S 电池接入电源模块"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:34
#: 56eaabcde9624d5aad8aa302e1c358f1
msgid ""
"the :ref:`Adafruit ESP8266 <common-esp8266-telemetry>` wifi telemetry board "
"should be connected to the Cube's Telem1 port"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Adafruit ESP8266 <common-esp8266-telemetry>` WiFi 数传板应连接至 Cube 的 "
"Telem1 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:35
#: d7a3a6d29a144b46ae8ef654e14b8f56
msgid ""
"the frame apparently includes this `WP-1040-Brushed ESC "
"<http://www.redcatracing.com/manuals/HW-WP-1040-Brushed.pdf>`__ and the "
"\"Reverse\" jumper should be set as shown below."
msgstr ""
"车架显然包含此 `WP-1040-Brushed ESC <http://www.redcatracing.com/manuals/HW-"
"WP-1040-Brushed.pdf>`__，应按下图所示设置「Reverse」跳线。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:40
#: e3219f5a06474568aacf7e6285174bb9
msgid "Firmware used: Rover-3.4.1"
msgstr "固件版本：Rover-3.4.1"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:42
#: 3d01ffc5c2424f94b741146e61120f65
msgid ""
"Parameter file: `ThunderTiger-ToyotaHilux-Rover "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/ThunderTiger-"
"ToyotaHilux-Rover.param>`__"
msgstr ""
"参数文件：`ThunderTiger-ToyotaHilux-Rover "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/ThunderTiger-"
"ToyotaHilux-Rover.param>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:44
#: aed4f6681bf14336aa91725750202bda
msgid "This parameter file can be loaded using the Mission Planner:"
msgstr "此参数文件可通过 Mission Planner 加载："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:46
#: 8f0da55e50664597b158a31d3fbcd84a
msgid "start the Mission Planner and connect to the autopilot"
msgstr "启动 Mission Planner 并连接到自动驾驶仪"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:47
#: afe4a61d01bf4cfe85018e5930841691
msgid "open the Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree page"
msgstr "打开「Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree」页面"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:48
#: 50f1500464b54fd393693f3977e9bc8f
msgid ""
"select \"ThunderTiger-ToyotaHilux-Rover\" from the drop down on the middle "
"right and then push the \"Load Presaved\" button"
msgstr "从右中部下拉菜单选择「ThunderTiger-ToyotaHilux-Rover」，然后点击「Load Presaved」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:52
#: d809aa792ca24ec08769ca4897309cd8
msgid ""
"The parameter file above includes setting the :ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT "
"<COMPASS_ORIENT>` parameter \"4\" (Yaw 180) because the wiring was more "
"convenient if the GPS arrow was pointing backwards"
msgstr ""
"上述参数文件中将 :ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT <COMPASS_ORIENT>` 参数设为「4」（Yaw 180），因为 GPS "
"箭头朝后时走线更方便"
